{"id":"jbkhyax7gdo8nmjxd7qinj1xu","title":"哈萨克斯坦计划发行代币化政府债券","originalTitle":"哈萨克斯坦计划于2027年Q1发行代币化政府债券","summary":"哈萨克斯坦央行行长Timur Suleimenov宣布，该国计划于2027年第一季度发行代币化政府债券。此前（2026年11月）哈萨克斯坦已通过KASE平台完成首期代币化央行票据发行（规模100亿坚戈），本次债券将代表财政部债务而非央行债务。技术方案采用Solana区块链，但BitGo是否参与本次债券发行尚未确认。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"PANews"},"links":{"original":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a1dabc-0ad9-70fb-a492-662f35e9ca35"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-14T15:45:21.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-14T15:59:42.626Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-14T15:59:42.626Z","category":"crypto-policy","tags":["政策发布"],"score":51,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"4dd03a5b-d3c1-416b-aa34-b466f905bc8e","title":"哈萨克斯坦首次将主权债务代币化，发行主体从央行转为财政部"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"4dd03a5b-d3c1-416b-aa34-b466f905bc8e","title":"哈萨克斯坦首次将主权债务代币化，发行主体从央行转为财政部"}],"topics":[{"slug":"regulation","name":"监管与政策"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fQtWlywu9VFY","reportCount":2,"additionalSourceCount":1},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}